OL,3,GNEWSAHidden stained-glass masterpieces
OL,4,Ago on display in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt wasn't just ships and locomotives
OL,7,Fwhich earned Glasgow the title of
OL,8,Fworkplace of the world.
OL,10,FIn the 18th and early 19th Century,
OL,11,FScotland was also celebrated for its
OL,12,Farts and crafts, and stained-glass
OL,13,Fproduction was at the centre of it all.
OL,15,FSome of that glass was shipped to
OL,16,Flocations across the world, like
OL,17,FBudapest where James Guthrie's Thistle
OL,18,Fwindow can still be seen in the museum
OL,19,Fof decorative arts.
